  "body": "This change also moves the \"create an entry\" algorithm to HTML, adding to it the conversion to scalar value strings that previously took place in \"append an entry\". It also links various unlinked usages of \"entry list\" and \"entry\" to these definitions.\n\nCloses #6701.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7371/custom-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 26, 2021, 1:34 PM UTC (2fef523)\">/custom-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7371/08b4033...2fef523/custom-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 26, 2021, 1:34 PM UTC (2fef523)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7371/form-control-infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 26, 2021, 1:34 PM UTC (2fef523)\">/form-control-infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7371/08b4033...2fef523/form-control-infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 26, 2021, 1:34 PM UTC (2fef523)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7371/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 26, 2021, 1:34 PM UTC (2fef523)\">/indices.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7371/08b4033...2fef523/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 26, 2021, 1:34 PM UTC (2fef523)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7371/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 26, 2021, 1:34 PM UTC (2fef523)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7371/08b4033...2fef523/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 26, 2021, 1:34 PM UTC (2fef523)\">diff</a> )",
